    "subhead": "While everybody watches the URL marquee cards, the Black women-led league has been building the deepest roster in the sport.",
    "description": "Queen of the Ring is a Black-owned, women-led battle rap league that the mainstream ignores. Why QOTR matters this summer and who to watch on the X timeline.",
