    "headline": "The Akai MPC Sample Is the Gear Story of 2026",
    "subhead": "A pocket-size, battery-powered MPC built on MPC60 DNA for $400 - and three months in, it's still nearly impossible to buy.",
    "description": "The Akai MPC Sample is a $400 battery-powered standalone sampler inspired by the MPC60 and MPC3000. Specs, why it sold out, and why producers won't stop talking about it.",
    "publishedAt": "2026-06-25",
