    "subhead": "CD Projekt Red and Studio Trigger set the Edgerunners 2 first look for June 29, with a full panel at Anime Expo July 3.",
    "description": "Cyberpunk: Edgerunners 2 gets its first look June 29, 2026, with an Anime Expo panel July 3 and a tie-in mission chain in Cyberpunk 2077's Update 2.4. The details.",
