    "headline": "Clockwork Revolution Puts Time in Your Hands",
    "subhead": "inXile's steampunk RPG dropped June 5 with a bold hook — change the past, watch the present rewrite itself — and it's pulling the single-player crowd.",
    "description": "Clockwork Revolution released June 5, 2026 on PC, PS5 and Xbox — a steampunk RPG built around time manipulation. Why the single-player crowd is locked in.",
