    "heroCreditUrl": "https://versetracker.com/events/url-ultimate-rap-league-summer-madness-15",
    "body": "Summer Madness is battle rap's Super Bowl, and URL just dropped a name on the card that made the timeline stop scrolling.\n\n## The matchup\nLoaded Lux vs Twork is set for Summer Madness 15. That's a legend — one of the most respected pens to ever touch the culture — against a younger, hungrier writer who's been building a real case for himself on the URL stage. Lux doesn't battle often. When he does, the whole community plans around it.\n\n## Why Lux still matters\nLux is a measuring stick. His classic performances are the ones new battlers study to learn structure, scheme, and how to build a round that lands like a sermon. Picking up Twork — a sharp, fast-rising name — isn't a victory lap. It's a real test, and that's exactly why it's the most talked-about slot on the card.\n\n## The bigger picture\nThis is the lane we always show love to: Black battle rappers and Black-owned leagues moving the culture forward without waiting on mainstream permission. URL built an empire on the strength of these matchups. Summer Madness is where the stakes are highest, and a Lux appearance raises the ceiling on the whole event.\n\n## What to watch\nThe rest of the card is filling in around it. Keep URL's channels close for the official date and the full lineup, because a Lux battle moves pay-per-view numbers by itself.\n\n## Sources\n- VerseTracker — \"Summer Madness 15 — URL: Ultimate Rap League\": https://versetracker.com/events/url-ultimate-rap-league-summer-madness-15\n- Ultimate Rap League (@urltv) on X: https://x.com/urltv\n- Ultimate Rap League — Tickets & 2026 dates (Ticketmaster): https://www.ticketmaster.com/ultimate-rap-league-tickets/artist/1860465",
