    "body": "Some returns you don't have to explain. Jujutsu Kaisen is one of the biggest anime on the planet, and Season 3 starts streaming July 10 — on Hulu, sub and dub, day and date enough that nobody's stuck waiting months for the English track.\n\n## Where the story's at\nSeason 3 moves into the stretch fans have been bracing for. MAPPA's adapting the arc where the whole board tears open and the roster of players explodes — higher stakes, more sorcerers, the kind of run that turns casual watchers into people arguing in the group chat every week. If you've followed the manga you know why this one carries weight. If you haven't, going in blind is half the fun.\n\n## Why it's a lead, not a footnote\nThe anime block is big-name only, and few names pull the numbers JJK does. Netflix and Hulu both moved to get this season fast because demand is that high — a top-tier, in-demand title landing this quickly is a genuine event, not a quiet drop.\n\nSet the reminder for the 10th. This is appointment viewing, and the timeline's going to be loud about it.\n\n## Sources\n- [ComicBook — 6 new anime coming to Hulu in July 2026](https://comicbook.com/anime/list/6-new-anime-coming-to-hulu-in-july-2026/)\n- [Collider — Best anime coming to Netflix and Crunchyroll in July](https://collider.com/best-anime-netflix-crunchyroll-july-2026/)\n- [GamesRadar — New anime in 2026](https://www.gamesradar.com/new-anime-release-dates-upcoming-schedule/)",
