    "subhead": "Sparks of Tomorrow, the summer's most talked-about original, premiered July 5 on Netflix with the kind of visuals only Kyoto Animation delivers.",
    "description": "Sparks of Tomorrow, an original historical fantasy from Kyoto Animation, premiered July 5, 2026 on Netflix and is streaming weekly, drawing attention as one of the biggest new anime of the summer season.",
