    "title": "Ye's Madrid and Algarve Dates Are Still On",
    "headline": "The Dates Nobody Organized to Stop",
    "subhead": "Europe pulled show after show. Madrid on July 30 and the Algarve on August 7 are the two that are still standing.",
    "description": "The UK, France, Poland, Switzerland and Italy cancelled Ye's 2026 dates. Madrid on July 30 and the Algarve on August 7 are the two still standing.",
