    "body": "Big-name anime only on this pillar, and Mushoku Tensei clears that bar easy. The show a lot of people credit with resetting the isekai bar is back for a third season.\n\n## The return\nSeason 3 arrives in the Summer 2026 lineup, and the pitch is that it reaches a whole new level — the story finally unravelling the biggest mysteries of its world. For a series this dense, that's the payoff fans have been waiting on, not filler.\n\n## Why it matters\nMushoku Tensei set the modern isekai standard on the strength of Studio Bind's production and a story that took its world seriously. When it comes back, it's not a niche premiere — it's one of the tentpoles the whole season gets measured against.\n\n## Where it sits this summer\nIt lands in a stacked season, but it's in the top tier of the returns — the kind of show that pulls lapsed viewers back in. If you fell off, this is a natural re-entry point given the mystery focus.\n\n## What to watch\nWatch the streaming home and the episode cadence at premiere, and whether the production keeps the bar the first two seasons set.\n\n## Sources\n- Anime News Network — The Most Anticipated Anime of Summer 2026\n- Comicbook — New Summer 2026 anime sequels to watch this July",
