    "subhead": "Image-Line dropped FL Studio 2026 with a fully rebuilt FLEX, cloud backup and an assistant that runs the DAW — free for everyone who already owns it.",
    "description": "FL Studio 2026 is here: a rebuilt FLEX (up to 50% less CPU), FL Cloud backup, the new Transmitter plugin, and it's free for every existing license holder.",
