    "ogHeadline": "Banned everywhere.\nSelling out anyway.",
    "ogAccent": "1B3A5B",
    "heroCredit": "Ye Live Concert Tour (Wikipedia)",
    "heroCreditUrl": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ye_Live_Concert_Tour",
    "body": "Forget the take for a second and look at the numbers. The YE Live Concert Tour — Ye's first headlining run in a decade — reportedly moved around 118,000 tickets for a single show in Istanbul, a figure being called an all-time high for a stadium performance. Whatever you think of the man, that's a business story.\n\nThis is the same artist who got shows pulled across Europe and lost festival sponsors. On paper the tour shouldn't exist at this scale. It does anyway, and the demand keeps proving itself city to city.\n\n## The record nobody saw coming\n\nA reported 118K in one stadium isn't a rounding error — it's the kind of gate that puts a run in the record conversation with the biggest tours ever booked. It's early reporting, so treat the exact count as reported-not-confirmed. But the direction is clear: the rooms are enormous and they're filling.\n\n## The US leg keeps stacking\n\nBack home the calendar keeps growing behind 'Bully' — a one-night Caesars Superdome stop in New Orleans on August 28, a two-night homecoming stand at Chicago's Soldier Field on September 3 and 4, and a San Antonio Alamodome date earlier in the run. Stadiums, not arenas. That's a statement about where the demand actually is.\n\n## Why the business matters here\n\nWe run a beat company. We pay attention to who can still move a building in a streaming era, because that's who's actually got leverage. Say what you want about the headlines — the ticket counts are telling on everybody who wrote him off. The GOAT is running up numbers most acts will never touch.\n\nThat's the story: the most controversial name in music, quietly posting some of the loudest tour figures of the year.\n\n## Sources\n\n- [Ye Live Concert Tour (Wikipedia)](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ye_Live_Concert_Tour)\n- [Kanye West adds US stadium shows (Billboard)](https://www.billboard.com/music/rb-hip-hop/kanye-west-summer-tour-adds-chicago-san-antonio-shows-1236272815/)\n- [Ye bringing 2026 tour to Caesars Superdome (FOX 8 New Orleans)](https://www.fox8live.com/2026/07/09/ye-bringing-2026-tour-caesars-superdome-new-orleans/)",
