    "body": "One of the most-watched anime of the last two years finally moved: Solo Leveling Season 3. A-1 Pictures used its Anime Expo 2026 panel to drop the first teaser footage and production art, giving fans the first real look at the next arc.\n\nGood news and a gut-check in the same breath — it's coming, but not soon.\n\n## The teaser everybody wanted\n\nSeason 2 turned Solo Leveling into a global phenomenon, so a first look at Season 3 was one of the most anticipated reveals of the Anime Expo slate. Teaser footage plus production artwork confirms the studio's deep in it, and Crunchyroll's leadership has said the team is actively working the next major arcs.\n\n## A movie comes first\n\nHere's the catch: a film, 'Solo Leveling: Beyond the System,' is set to land first, expected late 2026 or early 2027. Season 3 itself is tracking a 2027-2028 window. So the reveal is a marker, not a countdown — the wait is real, but the pipeline's confirmed.\n\n## Why we're on it anyway\n\nThis is a marquee title with a massive 25-45 audience, and the reveal is fresh off Anime Expo. Even a 'here's where it stands' update on a series this big is worth the segment. The hype is real; the patience is the price.\n\nThe hunter's coming back. Just bring a calendar.\n\n## Sources\n\n- [Solo Leveling Season 3 release date speculation (GamesRadar)](https://www.gamesradar.com/entertainment/anime-shows/solo-leveling-season-3-release-date-trailer-story-cast-news/)\n- [Solo Leveling Season 3 officially confirmed with new window (CBR)](https://www.cbr.com/solo-leveling-season-3-2027-release/)",
