    "heroCreditUrl": "https://www.fox8live.com/2026/07/09/ye-bringing-2026-tour-caesars-superdome-new-orleans/",
    "body": "We opened the show here because it's the piece of the Ye story you can actually act on. The tour's been a headline all summer — the chart run, the record gates overseas. This week it turns into something simpler: tickets. The US stadium leg hits general on-sale July 17.\n\nThe anchor is New Orleans. Ye plays the Caesars Superdome on August 28 — his first show in the city in 13 years.\n\n## When you can actually buy\n\nGeneral tickets for the Superdome date go on sale July 17 at 10 a.m., after a presale window that opened earlier in the week. Fans who pre-registered on the tour site were entered for presale access, and some were selected for free pairs. If you want in without the resale markup, the on-sale is the move.\n\n## Why the US leg matters\n\nThis is the first headlining Ye tour in a decade, and it's running in stadiums, not arenas. New Orleans is one stop in a six-night American run built on 'Bully.' Booking a building the size of the Superdome for a one-night stand is a statement about where the demand actually sits — and it's a long way from the man festivals were dropping a year ago.\n\n## The business read\n\nWe run a beat company, so we watch who can still fill a room in a streaming era — that's who's got real leverage. Ye moving stadium inventory this fast, this deep into controversy, tells you the audience never left. Say what you want about the noise; the on-sale is the receipt.\n\nIf you're going, set an alarm for the 17th. These rooms are big, but so is the demand.\n\n## Sources\n\n- [Ye bringing 2026 tour to Caesars Superdome (FOX 8 New Orleans)](https://www.fox8live.com/2026/07/09/ye-bringing-2026-tour-caesars-superdome-new-orleans/)\n- [Kanye West announces new stadium concert: how to get tickets (iHeart)](https://www.iheart.com/content/2026-07-10-kanye-west-announces-massive-new-concert/)\n- [Ye to perform in New Orleans for first time in 13 years (WWL-TV)](https://www.wwltv.com/article/news/local/orleans/ye-to-perform-in-new-orleans-for-1st-time-in-13-years-caesars-superdome-music-kanye-west-bully-album/289-fc65c5af-c273-4a43-b502-afe5e3192a3c)",
