    "heroCreditUrl": "https://blockclubchicago.org/2026/06/15/kanye-west-is-returning-home-with-2-september-soldier-field-performances/",
    "body": "We've spent the week on the tour — the on-sale, the Istanbul record, the New Orleans return. This one's different. This is Chicago.\n\nYe is booked at Soldier Field on September 3 and 4, two nights on the lakefront in the city that raised him. For a man whose whole origin story runs through the South Side, a stadium homecoming isn't just another date on the run.\n\n## Two nights on the lakefront\nYe plays Soldier Field on Thursday, September 3 and Friday, September 4, 2026. The pair of Chicago shows were confirmed as part of his US stadium leg, sitting near the end of a run that stretches through the summer.\n\n## The run around it\nThe Chicago dates landed alongside other American stadium stops — the New Orleans Superdome on August 28, and a San Antonio Alamodome show earlier in the summer. It's West's first headlining tour in a decade, since the Saint Pablo run in 2016.\n\n## The album under it\nAll of it rides on Bully, his twelfth studio album, out in March 2026. It debuted at No. 2 on the Billboard 200 with about 152,000 equivalent units, and sixteen of its eighteen tracks hit the Hot 100. The tour is the album made physical.\n\n## Why Chicago hits different\nEvery stadium on this tour is a headline. Chicago is a homecoming. The city has a complicated, loud, loving relationship with Ye — and two nights at Soldier Field is the kind of moment that gets talked about long after the lights go down. Report it straight; the story tells itself.\n\nHe's the most argued-about man in music, and he's about to fill his hometown's stadium twice. That's the show.\n\n## Sources\n- Block Club Chicago — Ye returning home with two September Soldier Field shows: https://blockclubchicago.org/2026/06/15/kanye-west-is-returning-home-with-2-september-soldier-field-performances/\n- Billboard — Kanye West's summer tour adds Chicago & San Antonio shows: https://www.billboard.com/music/rb-hip-hop/kanye-west-summer-tour-adds-chicago-san-antonio-shows-1236272815/\n- NBC News — Ye schedules shows at Chicago's Soldier Field: https://www.nbcnews.com/pop-culture/music/ye-formerly-kanye-west-schedules-shows-chicagos-soldier-field-summer-rcna350124\n",
    "publishedAt": "2026-07-17"
