    "body": "If the 1 is the icon and the 4 is the crowd favorite, the 12 is the one grown men reach for. This fall it comes back dressed right.\n\n## The date\nThe Air Jordan 12 'Bucks' — summit white with gorge green, black and fierce purple — is scheduled for September 19, 2026 at $215. It's the nearest of the fresh fall retros worth circling.\n\n## Why the 12 hits different\nThe 12 is the tank of the line: stitched leather, that carbon-fiber-feeling build, a shoe that looks like it costs more than it does. It's less about hype and more about presence. You put on a 12 and it holds a fit down without trying.\n\n## The color story\nGreen and purple on a clean white base reads like a team makeup without being loud about it. It's grown, it's seasonal, and it works with more of your closet than a bright loud pair does. That's the 12's whole personality — quiet money.\n\n## Where it sits on the board\nOn a stacked fall calendar, the 12 'Bucks' is the pick for the buyer who's past chasing the most-hyped release and just wants the shoe that looks best on. Nearest drop of the fresh fall crop, too, so it clears the shelf first.\n\nNot every Jordan needs to shout. The 12 'Bucks' walks in quiet and still runs the room. September 19.\n\n## Sources\n- Sneaker Bar Detroit — Air Jordan release dates 2026: https://sneakerbardetroit.com/air-jordan-release-dates/\n- Nice Kicks — Jordan release dates 2026: https://www.nicekicks.com/air-jordan-release-dates/\n- House of Heat — every major Air Jordan releasing for fall 2026: https://houseofheat.co/jordan/air-jordan-releases-fall-2026\n",
