    "body": "Jujutsu Kaisen is one of the biggest names MAPPA has, and its most divisive arc is about to reach a whole new audience. This is a distribution story, not a delay story.\n\n## What's happening\nJJK Season 3 — The Culling Game: Part 1 — premiered back in January 2026 with a two-episode opener and wrapped its run on March 27. Now it's rolling out on Netflix in July 2026, putting the arc in front of the massive crowd that waits for shows to hit the platform. Right after Part 1 ended, a continuation — The Culling Game: Part 2 — was announced.\n\n## Why the Culling Game matters\nThis is the arc that follows the Shinjuku Showdown and the fallout from Gojo's iconic battle — the manga's most frenzied, battle-royale stretch, and some of its most debated chapters. When these episodes land in front of a new audience, social media catches fire for weeks. It's the definition of a marquee moment.\n\n## The confirmed vs. the patient\nPart 1 on Netflix in July is real and now. Part 2 is confirmed as the next chapter, but treat any specific air date going around as unconfirmed until MAPPA dates it. Direction locked, calendar pending — that's the honest read.\n\n## Why it leads the pillar\nBig-name IP, a fresh wave of eyes, and an arc built to blow up group chats. When one of anime's biggest series pushes its most-argued story to Netflix and confirms there's more coming, that's the anime lead.\n\nThe Culling Game was always going to spread. Now it's got the biggest platform in the world to do it. Tune in.\n\n## Sources\n- What's on Netflix — Jujutsu Kaisen The Culling Game Netflix release date: https://www.whats-on-netflix.com/news/anime/jujutsu-kaisen-the-culling-game-netflix-release-date/\n- Wikipedia — Jujutsu Kaisen season 3: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jujutsu_Kaisen_season_3\n- Crunchyroll — Jujutsu Kaisen Season 3 The Culling Game: https://www.crunchyroll.com/news/latest/2025/8/31/jujutsu-kaisen-season-3-the-culling-game-premieres-in-january-2026\n",
