    "heroCreditUrl": "https://www.crunchyroll.com/news/latest/2025/12/20/kaiju-no-8-anime-final-chapter-production-announced",
    "body": "Some shows overstay. This one drew a line. Kaiju No. 8 has confirmed how it ends — and it's not stringing anybody along.\n\n## What was announced\nAt Jump Festa 2026, the series confirmed its final season: a four-episode Final Chapter, produced again by Production I.G, that carries the anime to the pre-planned end of its story. Not a filler-padded farewell season — a tight, four-episode conclusion arc built to finish what the show started.\n\n## Why four episodes is the news\nThat length is a statement. Four episodes says the studio is adapting a specific endgame stretch at high intensity rather than stretching the finish to squeeze another full cour out of the property. For an action series built on giant-monster spectacle and Production I.G's animation, a short, focused final chapter points at a big-budget sprint to the finish instead of a slow fade.\n\n## The timing\nThere's no locked premiere date yet. As of now the expectation is late 2026 or early 2027, with international streaming on Crunchyroll — simulcast subtitled, dub to follow — same as the first two seasons. There's also a side short, Narumi's Week at Work, focused on Gen Narumi, slated somewhere in the mid-to-late 2026 window. State the confirmation as fact; treat the exact date as still open.\n\n## What it means for the fandom\nKaiju No. 8 built a loyal crowd on clean action and a likable underdog in Kafka Hibino. Giving that crowd a defined ending — announced, not dragged out — is the kind of respect fans don't always get. The wait's real, but the finish line is drawn.\n\nFour episodes to close it out. The end is coming, and it's on purpose.\n\n## Sources\n- Crunchyroll — Kaiju No.8 Anime Final Chapter Production Announced: https://www.crunchyroll.com/news/latest/2025/12/20/kaiju-no-8-anime-final-chapter-production-announced\n- The GWW — Kaiju No. 8 Season 3 Final Chapter Confirmed: https://thegww.com/kaiju-no-8-season-3/\n- The Anime Daily — Kaiju No. 8 Season 3: Final Chapter, release outlook: https://www.theanimedaily.com/kaiju-no-8-season-3-release-date/\n",
