    "body": "Lead the sneaker talk with the one that drops first. The Air Jordan 4 'Comic' is set for July 25 at $230, and it's the nearest retro on the whole board — so it gets the front slot.\n\n## The colorway\nThe 'Comic' runs an Off White base with Anthracite and Neutral Grey, then breaks the calm with Fire Pink, Light Arctic Pink and Muslin. It's a loud, playful treatment on the most bankable silhouette Jordan makes — the kind of 4 that reads as a statement, not a staple.\n\n## Why the 4 keeps leading\nThe Air Jordan 4 is the safest shape in the building. It sits right for most feet, it's easy to style, and a bold colorway on a 4 moves faster than the same idea on a riskier model. That's why loud 4s keep landing near the top of the calendar — the silhouette carries the risk for you.\n\n## Nearest date wins the slot\nOn this show, sneakers get ranked by hype plus how soon they drop. A July 25 date beats an August one, and the 'Comic' is the closest Jordan retro in the window. Front of the line by the rules, not by vibes.\n\n## How to actually cop\nAt $230, this is a full-price release, which means the SNKRS lottery and quick sellouts. Have your size saved and payment ready before launch. A loud 4 like this tends to have a wide fanbase and a thin margin between drop and gone.\n\n## Sources\n- Sneaker Bar Detroit: Air Jordan release dates 2026 — https://sneakerbardetroit.com/air-jordan-release-dates/\n- Nice Kicks: Jordan release dates — https://www.nicekicks.com/air-jordan-release-dates/\n- SneakerFiles: Air Jordan release dates — https://www.sneakerfiles.com/air-jordan-release-dates/",
