    "heroCreditUrl": "https://collider.com/delicious-in-dungeon-season-2-update-first-look-netflix/",
    "body": "Round out anime with one the cult crowd's been asking about. At Anime Expo 2026, Delicious in Dungeon Season 2 got confirmed — with an honest catch on timing.\n\n## What's confirmed\nSeason 2 is official, set for an October 2027 release on Netflix, with a first look shown at the Anime Expo panel. Studio Trigger returns for the follow-up to one of the most quietly beloved anime of the last couple years — the show that turned dungeon-crawling and monster-cooking into must-watch TV.\n\n## Flag the date\nBe straight about it: October 2027 is a long runway. On this show, far-off stuff goes last and gets flagged, not hyped like it's next week. The news here is the confirmation and the first-look, not an imminent drop. State it plain and let the fanbase mark the calendar.\n\n## Why it still makes the show\nDelicious in Dungeon earned a real following by being weird in the best way — part cookbook, part party-based RPG, part heartfelt found-family story. It's a marquee title for the people who love it, and a confirmed Season 2 from Trigger is worth a slot even with a 2027 date. Loyalty runs deep on this one.\n\n## Sources\n- Collider: Delicious in Dungeon Season 2 update and first look — https://collider.com/delicious-in-dungeon-season-2-update-first-look-netflix/\n- Final Weapon: Delicious in Dungeon Season 2 October 2027 — https://finalweapon.net/2026/07/04/delicious-in-dungeon-season-2-october-2027/\n- GamesRadar: Delicious in Dungeon Season 2 — https://www.gamesradar.com/entertainment/anime-shows/delicious-in-dungeon-season-2-release-date-trailer-cast-dungeon-meshi/",
