    "body": "Middle of the sneaker board, a warm one: the Air Jordan 5 'Sunset.'\n\n## The details\nIt's a women's release set for September 25 at $215 — White with Sunset, Fire Red and Black. The name does the work: expect that warm-to-cool gradient washing across the upper on the 5's shark-tooth midsole. It's a softer, color-forward take on a shape that usually shows up in metallics and OG hits.\n\n## Why it's worth a look\nThe 5 is one of the most recognizable Jordans ever — the mesh side vents, the reflective tongue, the toothy midsole borrowed from a WWII fighter plane's nose. It carries color well because the shape is already busy in the right way. A sunset gradient is the kind of thing that either looks premium or looks like a phone wallpaper, and it'll come down to the material quality when they hit shelves. Women's-exclusive sizing means the run's a little tighter, so the ones that want it should move on it.\n\n## On the board\nLater in September than the 7, so it sits mid-pack — not a lead, but a genuine standout for anybody who wants a Jordan that isn't trying to look like every other Jordan. Fresh colorway, fresh shape versus anything we've run this week.\n\n## Sources\n- Just Fresh Kicks: Air Jordan release dates 2026 & 2027 — https://justfreshkicks.com/air-jordan-release-dates/\n- Sneaker Bar Detroit: Air Jordan release dates 2026 — https://sneakerbardetroit.com/air-jordan-release-dates/",
