    "pillar": "anime",
    "title": "Bleach: 'The Calamity' Ends It All — July 25",
    "headline": "The Last\nBankai.",
    "subhead": "This is the one. The final cour of Thousand-Year Blood War premieres July 25 — the actual end of Bleach's anime.",
    "description": "Bleach: Thousand-Year Blood War – The Calamity, the fourth and final cour, premieres July 25, 2026 on Hulu in the US and Disney+ internationally.",
    "keywords": [
      "Bleach The Calamity",
      "Bleach TYBW final part",
      "Bleach Thousand-Year Blood War release date",
      "Bleach July 25 2026",
      "Bleach final cour Hulu",
      "Sneakz and Beatz",
      "PHRHX"
    ],
    "ogHeadline": "The last\nbankai.",
    "ogAccent": "8A1E2E",
    "heroCredit": "VIZ Media — Bleach: TYBW – The Calamity",
    "heroCreditUrl": "https://www.viz.com/press-releases/v/1006765",
    "body": "Anime leads with the biggest, nearest moment on the board, and it doesn't get bigger or nearer than this: Bleach is ending.\n\n## The date\nBleach: Thousand-Year Blood War – The Calamity, the fourth and final cour, premieres July 25 — that's this week. It streams on Hulu in the US and Disney+ internationally, dropping at 7:30 AM PT the same day it airs at 11 PM in Japan. VIZ and Fathom even ran the first three episodes in US theaters back in late June to set it up. After a decade-plus wait and four years of this TYBW arc, the anime's actual conclusion is here.\n\n## Why it's the lead\nBleach is one of the pillars of the shonen 'Big Three,' and Thousand-Year Blood War has been the arc fans wanted animated their whole lives — the one the 2012 anime never reached. 'The Calamity' is the payoff to everything: the last stretch of the war against the Quincy, the final bankais, the end of Ichigo's story on screen. When a series this size lands its finale, it doesn't matter what else dropped that week — this is the story.\n\n## What to know going in\nIt's produced by Pierrot Films, directed by Tomohisa Taguchi, with Shiro Sagisu back on music — the crew that made this reboot feel like an upgrade instead of a retread. If you fell off Bleach years ago, this is the arc worth coming back for. Set the reminder for the 25th and go in cold on spoilers.\n\n## Sources\n- VIZ Media: July 25 premiere date for Bleach: TYBW – The Calamity — https://www.viz.com/press-releases/v/1006765\n- Variety: 'The Calamity' sets July premiere on Hulu, Disney+ — https://variety.com/2026/tv/news/bleach-thousand-year-blood-war-the-calamity-release-date-hulu-disney-1236799220/\n- Collider: Bleach final season release date & platform — https://collider.com/bleach-thousand-year-blood-war-final-season-4-release-date-hulu-july-25-2026/",
    "publishedAt": "2026-07-22",
    "goLiveAt": "2026-07-28T17:47:30.582Z"
