    "slug": "saga-of-tanya-the-evil-continuation-2026",
    "pillar": "anime",
    "title": "Saga of Tanya the Evil Returns",
    "headline": "The War\nPicks Back Up.",
    "subhead": "The dark military isekai people waited years for is finally continuing — a new run lands this summer.",
    "description": "The long-awaited continuation of Saga of Tanya the Evil arrives summer 2026 (July 8 window), bringing the dark military isekai back after years away.",
    "keywords": [
      "Saga of Tanya the Evil continuation",
      "Tanya the Evil season 2",
      "Youjo Senki 2026",
      "Saga of Tanya release date",
      "dark military isekai anime",
      "Sneakz and Beatz",
      "PHRHX"
    ],
    "ogHeadline": "The war\npicks back up.",
    "ogAccent": "2E2E2E",
    "heroCredit": "AniReload — Upcoming anime July 2026",
    "heroCreditUrl": "https://anireload.com/list-of-upcoming-anime-in-july-2026/",
    "body": "Round out anime with a comeback the genre's been waiting on: Saga of Tanya the Evil is continuing.\n\n## The details\nThe long-delayed continuation of the dark military isekai — known in Japan as Youjo Senki — is set to land this summer, with a July window putting it right in the mix. After years of a movie and a whole lot of 'when's it coming back,' the follow-up to Tanya's story finally has momentum again.\n\n## Why it's worth flagging\nTanya's a different animal from the usual isekai. No cozy fantasy town, no harem — a salaryman reincarnated as a small girl on a brutal alternate-history battlefield, weaponizing cold logic against a god she refuses to worship. It's sharp, mean, and smarter than its premise sounds, with some of the best-directed aerial-combat sequences the genre's produced. For a host who likes his fantasy with real stakes and a strategic streak, this one fits.\n\n## Where it lands\nPlace it last in the anime block — it's more cult than mainstream, and a niche-favorite comeback plays second to a franchise finale like Bleach. But 'niche' undersells it: this is a title with a serious following that had basically written off ever seeing more. A continuation is a genuine event for that audience. Confirm the exact platform and episode date on air before you send anybody chasing it.\n\n## Sources\n- AniReload: Ultimate list of upcoming anime in July 2026 — https://anireload.com/list-of-upcoming-anime-in-july-2026/\n- Complex: The new anime release guide (July 2026) — https://www.complex.com/pop-culture/a/khal/anime-release-guide",
