    "body": "The 12 is the boot of the family — the heaviest, sturdiest shape Jordan Brand still runs OG. This fall it picks a team to root for.\n\n## The look\nThe Air Jordan 12 'Bucks' pairs a summit white base with gorge green, black, and a fierce-purple hit — Milwaukee's palette, stitched onto the model built like a tank. The 12's signature rising-sun paneling and carbon-fiber toughness carry the color instead of fighting it.\n\n## Date and price\nIt's set for September 19, 2026 at $205, landing in the middle of a stacked Jordan fall that already includes the 4 'Tour Yellow' and the 8 'Chrome.' Standard 12 pricing, standard 12 build — no surprises on the sticker.\n\n## Where it fits\nTeam-coded 12s tend to move quieter than a loud collab but age better than a gimmick. This one photographs plain and wears rich, the way the best 12s always have. It's a grown-man pair — the kind you rotate for years, not the kind you flip in a week.\n\n## The read\nNot the flashiest release on the board, but the 12 doesn't need flash. Sturdiest silhouette in the lineup, clean team colors, fair fall timing. That's a keeper, not a hype cycle.\n\n## Sources\n- Sneaker Bar Detroit: Air Jordan Release Dates 2026 — https://sneakerbardetroit.com/air-jordan-release-dates/\n- Complex: Every Air Jordan Rumored to Release in 2026 — https://www.complex.com/sneakers/a/victor-deng/air-jordan-2026-release-dates\n- House of Heat: Jordan Release Dates — https://houseofheat.co/jordan-release-dates",
