    "ogHeadline": "One last\ntrip to Night City.",
    "ogAccent": "F2E641",
    "heroCredit": "ScreenRant - Cyberpunk 2077 Chrome #4",
    "heroCreditUrl": "https://screenrant.com/cyberpunk-2077-chrome-4-july-2026/",
    "body": "Cyberpunk always gets a beat, and this cycle it's the game universe on the page. Chrome #4 - the last issue of Dark Horse's Cyberpunk 2077 comic series - dropped July 15.\n\n## The comic send-off\nThe Chrome series has been the well-reviewed print home for Night City, praised for switching up storytelling styles and artwork while holding onto the atmosphere that made 2077 and Edgerunners land. Chrome #4 closes it out. If you've been following the books, this is the finale; if you never picked them up, the full run is a clean way back into the world that doesn't cost you another 60 hours in the game.\n\n## The rumor worth watching\nOn the game side, the sequel - working title Project Orion - has been in pre-production since 2025, with creative director Igor Sarzynski committing to first-person for maximum immersion. The fresh wrinkle is a job listing that mentions mobile devices among target platforms, which set players talking about where the franchise might go beyond console and PC.\n\n## Flag it as a rumor\nBe clear on air: the mobile angle is a job-listing read, not an announcement. Orion is still early, and CD Projekt Red hasn't confirmed anything about a mobile Cyberpunk. Report the listing, not a promise.\n\n## Why we always cover it\nCyberpunk earned its standing slot the hard way - a rough launch turned into one of the great redemption arcs in gaming, and Night City became a place people keep coming back to across games, anime and comics. The comic closing and the sequel quietly staffing up are two ends of the same story: the world isn't done.\n\n## Sources\n- ScreenRant: Cyberpunk 2077 returns for one last adventure (Chrome #4) - https://screenrant.com/cyberpunk-2077-chrome-4-july-2026/\n- VGTimes: Cyberpunk 2 latest news and rumors - https://vgtimes.com/games/cyberpunk-2/news/\n- Game Modifier: Cyberpunk 2077 Edgerunners 2026 update, Project Orion & roadmap - https://gamemodifier.com/blog/cyberpunk-2077-edgerunners-update-2026",
