    "body": "Cyberpunk always gets a beat on this show, and this cycle it's the anime side that's moving. Edgerunners is coming back, and it's got a window.\n\n## What's confirmed\nCyberpunk: Edgerunners 2 is set for a Fall 2026 release, exclusively on Netflix, and a new trailer got its public first look at Anime Expo in Los Angeles. It's 10 episodes, a standalone story described as \"a raw chronicle of redemption and revenge,\" made by a creative team that includes the people who made the first season land the way it did.\n\n## A brand-new crew\nSeason one wrecked people because it made you love a crew and then took them apart. Season two isn't rerunning that - it's a new set of characters in the same Night City. The confirmed four: Roman Carax, a young cinephile documenting life in the city; Talia Yang, corpo-raised and drawn toward crime; D, a Snake Nation netrunner chasing revenge for his murdered clan; and Weak \"King\" Kingsley, a veteran edgerunner living in the shadow of who he used to be.\n\n## Why it matters for this crowd\nThe first season didn't just ride the game's name - it became the reason a lot of people went back and played 2077 again. For an adult anime audience, Edgerunners hit because it was violent, stylish and genuinely sad, not a kids' show wearing neon. A second run from the same hands, tied to the same world, is one of the biggest anime swings of the fall.\n\n## The honest framing\n\"Fall 2026\" is a window, not a locked date, and casts and episode counts can shift before release. Lead with what's real: new trailer, new crew, Netflix, 10 episodes, this fall. That's plenty.\n\n## Sources\n- CD PROJEKT RED: Edgerunners 2 gets new trailer and Fall 2026 window - https://press.cdprojektred.com/en/news/1831/cyberpunk-edgerunners-2-gets-new-trailer-and-fall-2026-release-window\n- CD PROJEKT: Cyberpunk: Edgerunners 2 officially announced - https://www.cdprojekt.com/en/media/news/cyberpunk-edgerunners-2-officially-announced/\n- ScreenRant: Edgerunners Season 2 update at Anime Expo - https://screenrant.com/cyberpunk-edgerunners-season-2-update-anime-expo/",
