    "heroCredit": "Phantom Blade Zero (Official / State of Play 2026)",
    "heroCreditUrl": "https://www.gamebrief.net/blog/phantom-blade-zero-release-date-platforms",
    "body": "This is dead in the host's lane - a big, stylish single-player action game. And it just got a firm date worth marking.\n\n## The new date\nPhantom Blade Zero now launches October 29, 2026, moved from its previous September 9 target. The announcement came during PlayStation's June State of Play, and pre-orders open over the summer. It's hitting PC - Steam and Epic - at the same time as PS5, with a 12-month console exclusivity clause keeping it off other consoles until at least October 2027.\n\n## Why the delay is a good sign\nThe studio didn't push it to hide problems. The extra time is going into upgrading character models and reworking environments across the game, plus streamlining content and polishing key areas. In their words, they didn't want to ship it while there was still room to make it better. That's the delay you want - one that comes from ambition, not damage control.\n\n## What it actually is\nPhantom Blade Zero is a fast, combat-heavy action RPG with a \"kung fu punk\" style that's stood out every time it's shown. For a host who lives in single-player worlds, this is the kind of game that sells the whole medium - deep fighting system, strong art direction, no live-service leash pulling on it. A dense action game you play for the craft of the combat.\n\n## The takeaway\nA locked October date and pre-orders opening means this stopped being a \"someday\" game and became a fall-calendar game. If you've been watching the trailers wondering when you'd actually get to play it, now you can plan for it. Verify the exact pre-order date and any edition details on the official channels before you commit.\n\n## Sources\n- GameBrief: Phantom Blade Zero release date - https://www.gamebrief.net/blog/phantom-blade-zero-release-date-platforms\n- GosuGamers: Phantom Blade Zero delayed to October 2026 - https://www.gosugamers.net/entertainment/news/78529-phantom-blade-zero-delayed-to-october-2026-as-pre-orders-open-this-summer\n- Phantom Blade Zero (Wikipedia) - https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Phantom_Blade_Zero",
